
# Microsoft Sentinel SOC Lab
## Complete SIEM Integration From Scratch

A practical, step-by-step Microsoft Sentinel SOC lab covering Azure setup, Log Analytics, Sentinel onboarding, data connectors, KQL, detection rules, incidents, investigation, Syslog/CEF integration, and basic automation.

