# 18. Why Entra ID Is Important

Modern SOC investigations are heavily identity-driven.

A useful investigation chain is:

```text
User
 ↓
Authentication
 ↓
Device
 ↓
IP Address
 ↓
Application
 ↓
Resource
 ↓
Action
```

For example:

```text
User login
   ↓
Unusual IP
   ↓
MFA activity
   ↓
Azure resource access
   ↓
Privilege change
```

That is much more useful than looking at a single alert in isolation.

