# 22. CEF Integration

CEF means:

**Common Event Format**

Many security appliances can generate CEF-formatted events.

Architecture:

```text
Security Appliance
       ↓
      CEF
       ↓
Linux Log Forwarder
       ↓
Azure Monitor Agent
       ↓
Log Analytics
       ↓
Sentinel
```

CEF events generally appear in:

```text
CommonSecurityLog
```

Syslog events appear in:

```text
Syslog
```

Microsoft documents Syslog and CEF ingestion through Azure Monitor Agent and Data Collection Rules.

