# 30. Alert vs Incident

This distinction is critical.

```text
Event
 ↓
Detection
 ↓
Alert
 ↓
Incident
 ↓
Investigation
 ↓
Response
```

### Event

Raw activity.

### Alert

A detection rule identified suspicious activity.

### Incident

A security case that groups related alerts/entities for investigation.

