# 32. Build a Timeline

A useful SOC timeline:

```text
10:01:02  Failed login
10:01:05  Failed login
10:01:07  Failed login
10:01:10  Failed login
10:01:15  Successful login
10:01:20  Configuration change
```

The last two events radically change the investigation.

This is why:

> Never investigate a security alert as a single isolated event.

