# 33. Threat Hunting

Once your detection works, use the same data for proactive hunting.

Example:

```kusto
CommonSecurityLog
| summarize
    Events=count(),
    FirstSeen=min(TimeGenerated),
    LastSeen=max(TimeGenerated)
    by SourceIP
| order by Events desc
```

Now identify:

```text
High-volume IPs
Repeated activity
Unusual sources
Potential scanners
Potential brute-force sources
```

