# 41. Splunk vs Microsoft Sentinel

| Splunk | Microsoft Sentinel |
|---|---|
| Splunk Enterprise/Cloud | Microsoft Sentinel |
| Index | Log Analytics Workspace |
| Sourcetype | Table / schema |
| SPL | KQL |
| Forwarder | Azure Monitor Agent / connectors |
| Search | Logs |
| Correlation Search | Analytics Rule |
| Notable Event | Alert / Incident |
| ES Incident Review | Sentinel Incidents |
| SOAR | Automation / Playbooks |
| Dashboards | Workbooks |

The important conceptual difference is:

```text
Splunk:
Data → Index → SPL → Correlation → Alert

Sentinel:
Data → Workspace/Table → KQL → Analytics Rule → Alert → Incident
```

